---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Header from '../../components/Header.astro';
import RfqSection from '../../components/RfqSection.astro';
import Footer from '../../components/Footer.astro';
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import { images } from '../../data/images';
import servicesHero from '../../assets/images/pages/services/services-cnc-part-families-hero.webp';
---

<BaseLayout title="CNC Machining Capabilities" description="Explore Belaro Precision CNC machining and coordinated secondary process support for drawing-based OEM components.">
  <Header quoteHref="#rfq-form" />
  <main class="services-page">
    <section class="page-hero services-hero">
      <div class="services-hero-media"><Image src={servicesHero} alt="Machined mounting brackets with a stepped shaft and flanged bushing" widths={[480, 800, 1160, 1672]} sizes="100vw" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async" /></div>
      <div class="services-hero-shade" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <div class="container"><span class="eyebrow eyebrow-light">OUR CAPABILITIES</span><h1>Machining capability.<br/><em>Production focus.</em></h1><p>CNC machining and coordinated secondary process support for components manufactured to your engineering drawings.</p></div>
    </section>
    <section class="section"><div class="container">
      <div class="machining-overview"><h2>Custom CNC Machining</h2><p>Need a complete machining route? Explore milling, turning, coordinated finishing and drawing-based quotation in one place.</p><a class="button button-outline" href="/services/cnc-machining/">Explore CNC Machining <span aria-hidden="true">&#8594;</span></a></div>
      <div class="service-row" id="milling"><div class="service-image"><Image src={images['hero-cnc-milling']} alt="CNC milling machine cutting a metal component" widths={[480, 800, 1160]} sizes="(max-width: 700px) calc(100vw - 48px), 550px" loading="eager" decoding="async"/></div><div class="service-copy"><span class="eyebrow">01 / CNC MILLING</span><h2>Complex profiles.<br/><em>Controlled dimensions.</em></h2><p>3-axis, 3+2 positional and simultaneous 5-axis CNC milling for precision components used in industrial equipment and assemblies. Send your drawing so we can review feature access, material, tolerance and batch requirements.</p><ul class="check-list"><li>Machined plates, brackets and housings</li><li>3-axis, 3+2 positional and simultaneous 5-axis configurations</li><li>Drawing-based production review</li><li>Material and finish confirmed per project</li></ul><div class="milling-actions"><a class="button button-outline" href="/services/cnc-milling/">Explore CNC Milling <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a><a class="button button-orange" href="/contact/?process=milling#rfq-form">Request a Milling Quote <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></div></div>
      <div class="service-row service-row-reverse" id="turning"><div class="service-image"><Image src={images['hero-cnc-turning']} alt="Operator at a CNC turning machine" widths={[480, 800, 1160]} sizes="(max-width: 700px) calc(100vw - 48px), 550px" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/></div><div class="service-copy"><span class="eyebrow">02 / CNC TURNING</span><h2>Rotational parts.<br/><em>Made to drawing.</em></h2><p>Turning requirements can be reviewed for shafts, sleeves, bushings and other rotational components. Feasibility depends on dimensions, material, geometry and available process capability.</p><ul class="check-list"><li>Shafts and turned components</li><li>Sleeves, spacers and bushings</li><li>Threads and turned features, subject to review</li><li>Inspection criteria agreed before production</li></ul><div class="turning-actions"><a class="button button-outline" href="/services/cnc-turning/">Explore CNC Turning <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a><a class="button button-orange" href="/contact/?process=turning#rfq-form">Request a Turning Quote <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></div></div>
      <div class="service-row" id="secondary-processes"><div class="service-image"><Image src={images['secondary-ground-shaft-detail']} alt="Stepped shaft with contrasting journal and shoulder textures on a V-shaped support" widths={[480, 800, 1160]} sizes="(max-width: 700px) calc(100vw - 36px), 550px" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /></div><div class="service-copy"><span class="eyebrow">03 / SECONDARY PROCESSES</span><h2>Beyond machining.<br/><em>One coordinated requirement.</em></h2><p>The manufacturing ecosystem across Dongguan and Shenzhen gives Belaro Precision access to flexible supplier support for grinding, heat treatment, surface finishing and other secondary processes required by your drawing.</p><div class="secondary-tags"><span>Grinding</span><span>Heat Treatment</span><span>Surface Finishing</span></div><a class="button button-outline" href="/services/secondary-processes/">Explore Secondary Processes <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div></div>
      <div class="service-row service-row-reverse" id="production"><div class="service-image"><Image src={images['production-separated-components-batch']} alt="Slotted metal mounting brackets arranged in separate compartments of a blue tray" widths={[480, 800, 1160]} sizes="(max-width: 700px) calc(100vw - 36px), 550px" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /></div><div class="service-copy"><span class="eyebrow">04 / PRODUCTION SUPPORT</span><h2>Low-volume batches.<br/><em>Repeat-order mindset.</em></h2><p>Belaro Precision is positioned for OEM component requirements where communication, drawing control and repeatability matter. Indicative batch quantities are around 20–500 pieces, subject to part complexity and production review.</p><a class="button button-outline" href="/services/production/">Explore OEM production <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div></div>
    </div></section>
    <RfqSection description="Share your drawing, material, quantity and machining or secondary process requirements." />
  </main>
  <Footer quoteHref="#rfq-form" />
</BaseLayout>

<style is:global>
  /* 仅作用于本页，不依赖组件转发 Astro 作用域属性。背景等比裁切，正文完整显示。 */
  .services-page .services-hero{position:relative;isolation:isolate;overflow:hidden;padding:0;min-height:560px;display:flex;align-items:center}
  .services-page .services-hero:after{display:none}
  .services-page .services-hero-media{position:absolute;inset:0;z-index:-2}
  .services-page .services-hero-media img{display:block;width:100%;max-width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;object-position:center}
  .services-page .services-hero-shade{position:absolute;inset:0;z-index:-1;background:linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(9,23,42,.95),rgba(9,23,42,.82) 30%,rgba(9,23,42,.08) 65%,transparent)}
  .services-page .services-hero .container{position:relative;padding-block:72px}
  .services-page .services-hero h1{font-size:48px;line-height:1.15;max-width:470px;letter-spacing:0}
  .services-page .services-hero p{max-width:390px}
  .services-page .service-image,.services-page .service-copy{min-width:0}
  .services-page .service-image img{display:block;width:100%;max-width:100%;height:auto;object-fit:contain}
  .services-page .service-copy h2{letter-spacing:0}
  .services-page .machining-overview{border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);padding-bottom:36px;margin-bottom:60px}
  .services-page .machining-overview h2{font-size:32px;letter-spacing:0}
  .services-page .machining-overview p{color:var(--muted);max-width:720px}
  .services-page .milling-actions,.services-page .turning-actions{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(min(100%,260px),1fr));gap:12px;width:100%;max-width:540px}
  .services-page .secondary-tags{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px;margin:24px 0 30px}
  .services-page .secondary-tags span{background:var(--soft);border:1px solid var(--line);padding:8px 12px;font-size:16px;font-weight:600}
  @media(max-width:1100px){
    .services-page .services-hero h1{font-size:42px;max-width:410px}
    .services-page .services-hero-shade{background:linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(9,23,42,.94),rgba(9,23,42,.72) 45%,rgba(9,23,42,.12))}
  }
  @media(max-width:700px){
    .services-page .services-hero{min-height:620px;align-items:flex-start}
    .services-page .services-hero-media img{object-position:64% center}
    .services-page .services-hero-shade{background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(9,23,42,.94),rgba(9,23,42,.8) 46%,rgba(9,23,42,.12))}
    .services-page .services-hero h1{font-size:36px}
    .services-page .services-hero .container{padding-block:44px}
    .services-page .milling-actions,.services-page .turning-actions{grid-template-columns:1fr}
    .services-page .milling-actions .button,.services-page .turning-actions .button{width:100%}
  }
</style>
